      "controversial_points": "German media clash over state control versus industry freedom in AI development. Data‑privacy advocates demand strict rules while business voices push for competitive flexibility. Labor unions fear job loss from automation, whereas conservatives cite productivity gains. The EU AI Act triggers tension between European sovereignty and German industry’s global ambitions. Digital infrastructure debates expose a divide between urban prosperity and rural broadband neglect."
